<title>USA: Goss Graphic Systems issues $225 million in debt.</title>
<headline>Goss Graphic Systems issues $225 million in debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following high-yield debt issue was priced late on Thursday, according to lead manager CS First Boston Corp.</p>
<p>BORROWER GOSS GRAPHIC SYSTEMS INC</p>
<p>AMT $225 MLN	  COUPON 12.00 PCT  MATURITY 10/15/2006</p>
<p>TYPE SNR SUB NOTES  ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 4/15/97 LAST MOODY B2	 SPREAD 540 BP     PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-B   YIELD 12.00 PCT   CALLABLE NON-CALL FIVE</p>
<p>NOTES THREE YEAR EQUITY CALL FOR 35 PCT AT 112 --U.S. corporate bond unit, 212-859-1672</p>
